### ========================================
### PROVEEDORES - /api/suppliers
### Reemplaza <TOKEN> con el token del login
### ========================================

### Crear proveedor
POST http://localhost:8080/api/suppliers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

{
  "code": "PROV-001",
  "name": "Laboratorios Bayer S.A.",
  "contactName": "Carlos Rodríguez",
  "email": "ventas@bayer.com",
  "phone": "6011234567",
  "address": "Zona Industrial, Bogotá",
  "taxId": "900123456-1"
}

### Actualizar proveedor
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/suppliers/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

{
  "code": "PROV-001",
  "name": "Laboratorios Bayer S.A. Colombia",
  "contactName": "Ana López",
  "email": "ana.lopez@bayer.com",
  "phone": "6019876543",
  "address": "Calle 100 # 7-33, Bogotá",
  "taxId": "900123456-1"
}

### Obtener proveedor por ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/suppliers/1
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Obtener proveedor por código
GET http://localhost:8080/api/suppliers/code/PROV-001
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Listar todos los proveedores
GET http://localhost:8080/api/suppliers
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Listar proveedores activos
GET http://localhost:8080/api/suppliers/status/active
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Desactivar proveedor
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/suppliers/1/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Activar proveedor
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/suppliers/1/activate
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
